Also, when she worked there, she did not write the reviews, but she did write an article about the 2007 Office Convention.
而且，她在那儿工作时并没有写过剧评，但她确实写过一篇关于2007年《办公室》大会的文章。

55
00:02:35.070 --> 00:02:38.750
And when Amelie joined The Office, the A.V.
而当阿梅莉加入《办公室》时，A.V.

