Club put this little note on their website that I thought was really charming.
俱乐部在他们的网站上发了这样一条小短讯，我觉得真的很有爱。

57
00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:43.370
Okay.
好的。

58
00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:44.530
Here's what it says.
上面是这么写的。

59
00:02:45.110 --> 00:02:52.990
In case you haven't heard, big ups are due to the lovely and talented Ms. Amelie Gillette who will be joining the writing staff of The Office.
如果你还没听说的话，我们要向可爱且才华横溢的阿梅莉·吉莱特女士致以崇高的敬意，她将加入《办公室》的编剧团队。

60
00:02:53.550 --> 00:03:02.830
Any of our TV Club regulars will tell you they have no intention of giving the show higher ratings just to suck up to her and maybe get a television writing gig of their own.
我们电视俱乐部的任何常客都会告诉你，他们绝没有打算给这部剧打更高分来拍她的马屁，顺便谋求一个自己的电视剧编剧工作。

61
00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:05.310
They'll tell you that, but I won't.
他们会这么说，但我不会。

62
00:03:05.570 --> 00:03:11.630
I preemptively declare all Amelie Gillette episodes of The Office to be an A-plus rating or higher.
我提前宣布，所有由阿梅莉·吉莱特参与的《办公室》剧集都将获得A加或更高的评分。

63
00:03:11.970 --> 00:03:12.510
Aww.
噢。

64
00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:14.330
And then they went on to say,
然后他们接着说道，

65
00:03:14.490 --> 00:03:20.510
Long-time readers also know that Nathan Rabin has traditionally covered The Office for TV Club.
老读者也知道，内森·拉宾传统上一直负责为电视俱乐部报道《办公室》。

66
00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:22.830
You'll also notice he's not anymore.
你们也会发现他不再负责了。

67
00:03:23.170 --> 00:03:27.950
We felt that anyone who is friends with Amelie should no longer write about the show,
我们觉得任何与阿梅莉是朋友的人都不应再撰写关于这部剧的文章，

68
00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:33.010
so we've brought in TV critic scholar and Office fan Miles McNutt,
所以我们请来了电视评论学者兼《办公室》粉丝迈尔斯·麦克纳特，

69
00:03:33.070 --> 00:03:36.870
who we're sure will do an excellent job and never befriend Amelie.
我们确信他会做得非常出色，并且绝不会与阿梅莉交朋友。

70
00:03:36.970 --> 00:03:38.670
He had to stay unbiased.
他必须保持公正。

71
00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:39.130
Yes.
是的。

72
00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:39.410
Yeah.
对。

73
00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:43.550
Please welcome him and keep your comments section hazing to a minimum.
请欢迎他，并尽量少在评论区对他进行恶整。

74
00:03:43.910 --> 00:03:44.230
Oh.
哦。

75
