So Miles McNutt did write a review of Todd Packer.
所以迈尔斯·麦克纳特确实写了一篇关于托德·帕克的剧评。

76
00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:49.550
Okay.
好吧。

77
00:03:49.930 --> 00:03:51.490
He gave it a B-minus.
他给了B减。

78
00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:52.070
Okay.
好吧。

79
00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:55.830
He really liked Jim and Dwight banding together.
他真的很喜欢吉姆和德怀特联手。

80
00:03:55.830 --> 00:03:58.490
He liked the Kevin storyline.
他喜欢凯文的那条故事线。

81
00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:02.290
He liked Pam and Andy and all of that.
他喜欢帕姆和安迪以及所有这些。

82
00:04:02.910 --> 00:04:04.950
He basically liked the episode.
他基本上很喜欢这一集。

83
00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:07.810
I mean, I read the review, but here's the thing.
我的意思是，我读了这篇剧评，但问题是。

84
00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:09.410
Why the B-minus?
为什么是B减？

85
00:04:09.630 --> 00:04:10.010
Yeah.
对。

86
00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:12.530
He doesn't like Todd Packer.
他不喜欢托德·帕克。

87
00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:16.070
Oh, well, then that's a tough episode to review.
哦，那这一集就很难评了。

88
00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:18.670
If Todd Packer's your least favorite character.
如果托德·帕克是你最讨厌的角色的话。

89
00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:19.290
Yeah.
对。

90
00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:19.750
Yeah.
对。

91
00:04:19.750 --> 00:04:24.530
He literally said he doesn't like Todd Packer or any episodes that feature his character.
他直言不讳地说他不喜欢托德·帕克，也不喜欢任何以这个角色为核心的剧集。

92
00:04:24.690 --> 00:04:25.230
B-minus.
B减。

93
00:04:25.390 --> 00:04:25.570
Oh.
哦。

94
00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:28.890
Well, there was more of Todd Packer in the shooting draft.
好吧，在拍摄初稿里其实有更多托德·帕克的戏份。

95
00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:29.510
Oh, no.
噢，不。

96
00:04:29.670 --> 00:04:31.010
It might have gotten a C.
那可能得拿个C了。

97
00:04:31.630 --> 00:04:33.010
I'm going to share it today.
我今天就要分享它。

98
00:04:33.390 --> 00:04:38.390
Miles, you might not like this podcast episode if we share more Todd Packer.
迈尔斯，如果我们分享更多托德·帕克的内容，你可能不会喜欢这期播客。

99
00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:38.630
Yeah.
对。

100
00:04:38.890 --> 00:04:43.490
Well, if you're looking for more Dave Koechner, I can help you out with Fast Fact No.
好吧，如果你想找更多戴夫·科克纳的内容，我可以帮你看一下快速事实第

101
00:04:43.570 --> 00:04:43.890
2.
2.

102
00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:44.410
Okay.
好的。

103
00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:46.910
Dave Koechner, of course, played Todd Packer.
戴夫·柯区纳，当然，他饰演了托德·帕克。

104
00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:47.530
Oh, yes.
哦，是的。

105
00:04:47.630 --> 00:04:48.250
Thank you, Angela.
谢谢你，安吉拉。

106
00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:51.550
Well, this is a fan question from Ella S.
嗯，这是一个来自华盛顿的埃拉·S的粉丝提问，

107
