嗯，埃拉，你猜对了。

111
00:05:06.190 --> 00:05:09.650
He did originally audition for the role of Michael Scott.
他最初确实是为迈克尔·斯科特这个角色去试镜的。

112
00:05:10.010 --> 00:05:15.490
Dave was at a fan expo in Boston, and he spoke about auditioning for Michael Scott
戴夫曾在波士顿的一个粉丝见面会上谈到过试镜迈克尔·斯科特的事情，

113
00:05:15.490 --> 00:05:20.850
and also about the fact that he was not even the original Todd Packer.
并且还提到了他甚至不是最初的托德·帕克这一事实。

114
00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:21.990
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

115
00:05:22.610 --> 00:05:23.770
I remember that.
我记得那个。

116
00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:32.070
I had auditioned for The Office, but they were using the same pilot episode from The British
我曾为《办公室》试镜，但他们用的是英国版《办公室》的同一集试播集，

117
00:05:32.070 --> 00:05:34.890
Office and just changed some American references.
只是改动了一些美式背景。

118
00:05:35.130 --> 00:05:38.790
I was a huge fan of the British version of The Office.
我是英国版《办公室》的超级粉丝。

119
00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:45.650
So when I'm reading for Michael's part, I can't get past Ricky Gervais' way he did it.
所以当我试读迈克尔的台词时，我无法摆脱瑞奇·热维斯的表演方式。

120
00:05:45.810 --> 00:05:47.470
Like, I can't think of anything else.
就是说，我脑子里想不出别的。

121
00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:49.230
So I didn't get it, obviously.
所以很显然，我没被选上。

122
00:05:49.850 --> 00:05:51.890
So then I went on to work on something else.
然后我就去忙别的事情了。

123
00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:54.210
They were on episode three of the first season.
他们当时正在拍摄第一季的第三集。

124
00:05:54.390 --> 00:05:56.910
They had hired an actor, and it just wasn't working.
他们雇了一个演员，但就是感觉不对劲。

125
